sequenceDiagram
    participant PipelineComp as ML Pipeline Component<br/>(Python Client)
    participant DSP as Data Science Pipelines<br/>(DSP)
    participant MLMD as MLMD gRPC Server<br/>8080/TCP gRPC/HTTP2
    participant MySQL as MySQL / MariaDB<br/>3306/TCP
    participant PostgreSQL as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP

    Note over PipelineComp,PostgreSQL: Flow 1: Pipeline Metadata Recording

    PipelineComp->>MLMD: PutExecutionType(type)<br/>gRPC/HTTP2, Optional TLS/mTLS
    MLMD->>MySQL: INSERT/UPDATE execution_type<br/>MySQL protocol, Optional SSL
    MySQL-->>MLMD: type_id
    MLMD-->>PipelineComp: PutExecutionTypeResponse

    PipelineComp->>MLMD: PutExecution(execution, artifacts, events, contexts)<br/>Atomic transaction
    MLMD->>MySQL: BEGIN; INSERT execution, artifacts, events, attributions, associations; COMMIT
    MySQL-->>MLMD: IDs
    MLMD-->>PipelineComp: PutExecutionResponse(execution_id, artifact_ids)

    PipelineComp->>MLMD: PutArtifacts(artifacts)<br/>gRPC/HTTP2
    MLMD->>MySQL: INSERT/UPDATE artifacts
    MySQL-->>MLMD: artifact_ids
    MLMD-->>PipelineComp: PutArtifactsResponse

    Note over PipelineComp,PostgreSQL: Flow 2: Lineage Graph Query

    DSP->>MLMD: GetLineageSubgraph(starting_nodes, max_num_hops)<br/>gRPC/HTTP2, Optional TLS/mTLS
    MLMD->>MySQL: SELECT artifacts, executions, events, contexts<br/>Recursive lineage traversal
    MySQL-->>MLMD: Lineage graph data
    MLMD-->>DSP: LineageSubgraph(artifacts, executions, events, contexts)

    DSP->>MLMD: GetArtifactsByContext(context_id)<br/>gRPC/HTTP2
    MLMD->>MySQL: SELECT artifacts JOIN attributions
    MySQL-->>MLMD: Artifact records
    MLMD-->>DSP: GetArtifactsByContextResponse

    DSP->>MLMD: GetExecutionsByContext(context_id)<br/>gRPC/HTTP2
    MLMD->>MySQL: SELECT executions JOIN associations
    MySQL-->>MLMD: Execution records
    MLMD-->>DSP: GetExecutionsByContextResponse

    Note over MLMD,PostgreSQL: Alternative: PostgreSQL backend (5432/TCP)
    Note right of MLMD: Same flows apply with PostgreSQL<br/>using PostgreSQL protocol<br/>and Optional SSL
